<title>UK: ROYAL BANK OF SCOTLAND RAISES BASE RATE.</title>
<headline>ROYAL BANK OF SCOTLAND RAISES BASE RATE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Royal Bank of Scotland said on Thursday it was raising its UK base lending rate to 7.0 percent from 6.75 percent with immediate effect.</p>
<p>The move came after the Bank of England announced a quarter point rate rise.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
